{"id":"5589","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5589_main_stratocumulus-radiatus-and-cumulus-fractus-and-humilis_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图中有两个低空云属：<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎</span>云种和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡</span>云种积云，以及<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>。这两个云属的云底在同一高度，都以<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">几乎平行的宽云带</span>（辐辏状云类）排列。还出现了小且极高的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">凝迹</span>。</p>\n<p>由于主要是层积云，因此，编码为CL = 5。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Ger Breman","location":"荷兰，泽沃德","latitude":"纬度: 52° 15' 54'' N","longitude":"经度: 5° 28' 34'' E","date":"10 April 2010 1127 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 5, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.7.12","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.7.12"}]}]}